WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.680
An enquiry arrives, you're busy with a
customer, or it's after hours

2
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:05.540
and you're asleep.

3
00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:10.980
Solara captures inquiries around the
clock, saving the details straight into

4
00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:11.840
your CRM.

5
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.900
With consent to call, Sophie, your AI
assistant, starts the conversation.

6
00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:21.500
She asks about their home, solar plans and
preferred callback time.

7
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.760
When the call ends, the summary and
outcome are saved against the lead.

8
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:30.300
A callback request sends your sales team
an email with the customer's details

9
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.680
and preferred time ready for someone to
confirm availability.

10
00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.840
So when you start your day, the context is
already there.

11
00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:41.500
Less chasing, less copying information
between tools,

12
00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:43.960
more time to focus on closing.

13
00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:48.660
Mark Automates, a little less admin, a lot
more you.
